{"step_index":179,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-08-17T14:34:47Z","content":"The architecture, sequence, state machine, and pipeline diagrams have been compiled into a markdown artifact and synced to Google Docs:\n\n* 📄 **Markdown File (Direct Artifact):** [architecture_diagrams.md](file:///usr/local/google/home/gauravrawat/.gemini/jetski/brain/ca4322d4-9341-4bd7-ad62-33640faaced0/architecture_diagrams.md)\n* 🔗 **Google Docs Link:** [HR Agentic Solution - Architecture & Workflow Diagrams (MVP 1)](https://docs.google.com/document/d/1nrm5wgf8b-Z0TUlzQG5WK6MIz427TjdzW-l4th_676g/edit)\n\n---\n\n### Summary of Mermaid Diagrams Included\n\n```\n┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐\n│                                VISUAL ARCHITECTURE SPECIFICATIONS                               │\n├───────────────────────────────┬─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤\n│ 1. High-Level Topology        │ • Full C4 container diagram: Client Chat UI, API Gateway & Auth │\n│    (System Architecture)      │   Proxy (`X-Authenticated-User`), Safety Interceptor, Agent     │\n│                               │   Orchestrator, Adapters, Vector DB, and Dead-Letter Queue.     │\n├───────────────────────────────┼─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤\n│ 2. Sequence Diagrams          │ • 2.1 Grounded Policy Q&A Flow (Strict grounding & citations).  │\n│    (Interaction Flows)        │ • 2.2 Leave Booking Flow (Calendar exclusions, HITL Card, WW).  │\n│                               │ • 2.3 Resilient Chained Medical Leave Flow (DLQ Forward Alert). │\n├───────────────────────────────┼─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤\n│ 3. State Machines             │ • 3.1 ServiceImmediately Incident Lifecycle (`New` -> `Closed`). │\n│    (Lifecycles & Guardrails)  │ • 3.2 WorkWeek Leave Request Lifecycle (`Draft` -> `Approved`). │\n├───────────────────────────────┼─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤\n│ 4. Security & Safety Pipeline │ • 5-stage pipeline: Input Ingestion -> Safety Guardrails        │\n│                               │   (<300ms) -> Orchestration RBAC -> Output Guardrails & PII    │\n│                               │   Scrubbing -> Audited Stream Delivery.                         │\n├───────────────────────────────┼─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤\n│ 5. Knowledge Base Pipeline    │ • RAG Sync Pipeline: Document Repository -> Webhook/CDC Trigger │\n│    (Ingestion & RAG Sync)     │   -> Semantic Chunker (512 tokens) -> Embedding -> Vector DB.   │\n└───────────────────────────────┴─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘\n```\n\n---\n\n### Master Project Deliverables Index:\n1. 📄 **Revised & Approved BRD (Clean):** [HR Agentic Solution BRD (MVP 1 - Revised & Approved)](https://docs.google.com/document/d/1gW-lwRWN1sltc0jUolYhFktNlzJ3App5d7z4AkivZlI/edit)\n2. 📝 **BRD with Tracked Changes & Comments:** [HR Agentic Solution BRD - With Tracked Changes](https://docs.google.com/document/d/1tHkqwbPOJ2HUlmTliaR-Ip0gnpAhxiIrXKcJxu0qlT4/edit)\n3. 🚀 **Functional Specs & Agile User Stories:** [HR Agentic Solution - Functional Specs & User Stories (MVP 1)](https://docs.google.com/document/d/190GK62Mq6ogskpDSTs55Ff4OqBmLzD3-JoEzreiIUqQ/edit)\n4. 📊 **Architecture & Workflow Mermaid Diagrams:** [HR Agentic Solution - Architecture & Workflow Diagrams (MVP 1)](https://docs.google.com/document/d/1nrm5wgf8b-Z0TUlzQG5WK6MIz427TjdzW-l4th_676g/edit) | [architecture_diagrams.md](file:///usr/local/google/home/gauravrawat/.gemini/jetski/brain/ca4322d4-9341-4bd7-ad62-33640faaced0/architecture_diagrams.md)"}
