i/brain/ca4322d4-9341-4bd7-ad62-33640faaced0/Copy%20of%20HR%20Agentic%20Solution%20BRD.url.json\nLast Edited: 2026-08-17T13:53:57Z\n\n[ARTIFACT: HR Agentic Solution - Architecture & Workflow Diagrams (MVP 1)]\nPath: file:///usr/local/google/home/gauravrawat/.gemini/jetski/brain/ca4322d4-9341-4bd7-ad62-33640faaced0/HR%20Agentic%20Solution%20-%20Architecture%20&%20Workflow%20Diagrams%20%28MVP%201%29.url.json\nLast Edited: 2026-08-17T14:34:47Z\n\n[ARTIFACT: HR Agentic Solution - Functional Specs & User Stories (MVP 1)]\nPath: file:///usr/local/google/home/gauravrawat/.gemini/jetski/brain/ca4322d4-9341-4bd7-ad62-33640faaced0/HR%20Agentic%20Solution%20-%20Functional%20Specs%20&%20User%20Stories%20%28MVP%201%29.url.json\nLast Edited: 2026-08-17T14:32:22Z\n\n[ARTIFACT: HR Agentic Solution BRD (MVP 1 - Revised & Approved)]\nPath: file:///usr/local/google/home/gauravrawat/.gemini/jetski/brain/ca4322d4-9341-4bd7-ad62-33640faaced0/HR%20Agentic%20Solution%20BRD%20%28MVP%201%20-%20Revised%20&%20Approved%29.url.json\nLast Edited: 2026-08-17T14:20:55Z\n\n[ARTIFACT: HR Agentic Solution BRD - Reviewed & Annotated]\nPath: file:///usr/local/google/home/gauravrawat/.gemini/jetski/brain/ca4322d4-9341-4bd7-ad62-33640faaced0/HR%20Agentic%20Solution%20BRD%20-%20Reviewed%20&%20Annotated.url.json\nLast Edited: 2026-08-17T13:57:19Z\n\n[ARTIFACT: HR Agentic Solution BRD - With Tracked Changes]\nPath: file:///usr/local/google/home/gauravrawat/.gemini/jetski/brain/ca4322d4-9341-4bd7-ad62-33640faaced0/HR%20Agentic%20Solution%20BRD%20-%20With%20Tracked%20Changes.url.json\nLast Edited: 2026-08-17T14:23:46Z\n\n[ARTIFACT: architecture_diagrams]\nPath: file:///usr/local/google/home/gauravrawat/.gemini/jetski/brain/ca4322d4-9341-4bd7-ad62-33640faaced0/architecture_diagrams.md\nLast Edited: 2026-08-17T14:34:12Z\n\n[ARTIFACT: brd]\nPath: file:///usr/local/google/home/gauravrawat/.gemini/jetski/brain/ca4322d4-9341-4bd7-ad62-33640faaced0/scratch/brd.md\nLast Edited: 2026-08-17T13:54:23Z\n\n[ARTIFACT: brd_v